losed; retained report states exact checked scope and limitations.\nSources: docs/history/thesis-restart-2026-10-04/acceptance-source-review.md\n\nComplete figure reproduction routes and integrate useful repairs\nOperational integration complete: all13figure routes executed, methods/exactness/screenshot defects repaired, source/PDF frozen and159-source scientific view reconciled. All children, executions and containers released.\nproject: oct04-candidate\nauthorization: Original remaining-weekly-quota thesis/repository authorization continues after user rejected premature scoped closure. Absolute stop 2026-10-04T02:00:00Z; no human questions, no external release.\nnext_step: Bounded run closed; preserved evidence and remaining project limits govern any later authorized continuation.\nSources: docs/history/thesis-continuation-2026-10-04/integration.md, docs/figure-reproduction.md\n\nIndependently check remaining empirical evidence and new output\nFinal independent acceptance81f5d804… binds101pages/all11required areas, retained-row checks,13figure chain, anchors, cache CLI, HKO executions and bounded second-environment build. No open blocking finding in scoped review; human PASS and full reproduction remain unknown.\nproject: oct04-candidate\nauthorization: Original remaining-weekly-quota thesis/repository authorization continues after user rejected premature scoped closure. Absolute stop 2026-10-04T02:00:00Z; no human questions, no external release.\nnext_step: Bounded run closed; preserved evidence and remaining project limits govern any later authorized continuation.\nSources: docs/history/thesis-continuation-2026-10-04/acceptance-ds-review.md\n\nCheck independent production-capacity mathematical anchors\nFour tests on14fixed bodies passed and independently accepted. Rational/dyadic wording corrected; no capacity algorithm changed.\nproject: oct04-candidate\nauthorization: Original remaining-weekly-quota thesis/repository authorization continues after user rejected