al identity binding; stop by 01:57 UTC.\nSources: docs/figure-reproduction.md\n\nIndependently audit retained DS claims\nConditional correlations, balancing summaries, seven optimizer rows and 20 geometries checked. Two low findings handed to integration: stale evidence path and omitted prediction method specification.\nproject: oct04-candidate\nauthorization: Bounded continuation assignment within original remaining-quota scope; no human questions, absolute stop 2026-10-04T02:00:00Z.\nnext_step: Integrated owner review and final identity binding; stop by 01:57 UTC.\nSources: docs/history/thesis-continuation-2026-10-04/acceptance-ds-review.md\n\nExecute printed HKO appendix and full certificate\nPrinted appendix core and copied full26-row verifier passed in existing Sage10.9 (7.11s and6.77s); canonical files unchanged and fresh summary byte-identical. Independent acceptance distinguishes finite predicate from analytic implication.\nproject: oct04-candidate\nauthorization: Bounded local validation within original thesis/repository authorization; no human questions, absolute stop02:00UTC.\nnext_step: Final acceptance and identity binding before deadline.\nSources: docs/history/thesis-continuation-2026-10-04/hko-execution/receipt.json\n\nCheck thesis build in a second cached tool environment\nInitial existing-image build failed on declared lmodern. One capped disposable retry installed that package+3dependencies and built101pages in22.64s total with0overfull/undefined. Candidate unchanged, container removed; cross-version PDF/text/raster identity not claimed.\nproject: oct04-candidate\nauthorization: Bounded local validation within original thesis/repository authorization; no human questions, absolute stop02:00UTC.\nnext_step: Final acceptance and identity binding before deadline.\nSources: docs/history/thesis-continuation-2026-10-04/cross-environment-build.json, docs/history/thesis-continuation-2026-10-04/cross-environment-repaired.json\n\nConsolidate worktrees onto main\nMerged remote divergence and all three worktree results, verified recovery/evidence, archived temporary outputs, reconciled merged scope and retired extra worktrees. Main is the only registered checkout; source branches and recovery archives retained. Nothing pushed.\nSources: docs/history/worktree-consolidation-2026-10-04/README.md"];
  "__parked" [label="UNSELECTED / PARKED · no execution\nCommunication diagnosis · BLOCKED\nSkill migration candidate · PARKED\nKnowledge cleanup / pilot · PARKED\nCloud automation · PARKED\nHistorical stop respected · DONE\nOptional result routes · PARKED\nOpen research packages · PARKED\nWriting method trial · PARKED\nDefine consequential friction and the stopping judgment · READY\nSpecify a comparison that can reject a candidate mechanism · READY\nCompare coordination at one integration boundary · READY\nSelect a version-aware per-thread prompt-composition view · READY\nLocal-maximality proofs and certificate navigation · DONE\nExact product-family proofs · DONE\nEmpirical interpretation and numerical example · DONE\nReproduction and evidence availability · DONE\nIndependent local-theorem review · DONE\nNumerical API-contract review · DONE", fontsize=11, fillcolor="#f1f0ed", color="#93918c", tooltip="Determine why agent communication tools failed\nBounded local diagnosis finished. Same daemon persisted through failures; multiple TUI MCP server processes turned over. Stale endpoint binding is plausible, but old-port ownership, shutdown/rebind evidence and original cause are unavailable. Current list verifies reads only.\nblocker: Historical endpoint ownership/binding evidence is unavailable; current successful reads do not establish original cause or legacy send recovery.\nplan_gap: Capture failing URL, socket owner/PID and endpoint-binding lifecycle events on the next natural failure. Do not launch repeated investigation or restart the shared daemon.\nproject: workflows\nauthorization: Only the recorded selected assignment is authorized; future activation/execution remains separately selected.\nSources: docs/coordination/current.json\n\nOptional local skill candidate, activation and fresh-client tests\nProposed nine-skill local package, Claude discovery adapters and focused acceptance route. Keep outside loaded paths until selected. This is a candidate route, not