  "__candidates_thesis" [label="THESIS · READY IF SELECTED\nFoundations / QP\nVariation / certificate\nProduct proof bridges\nDS reader disposition\nFigures / numerical example\nAI reflection map", fontsize=11, fillcolor="#fff7dc", color="#93918c", tooltip="Check current foundations and QP exposition\nRead Chapters 2 and 4 against backlog items 1: terminology, Rudolf input/output, cyclic-word operation and dependence/vertex-replacement bridges. Return surviving/solved/withdrawn findings with exact source locations; no edits or theorem strengthening.\nplan_gap: Independent candidate route; no separate assignment under this ID. Selected restart coverage is recorded under oct04-candidate and its owned packets.\nproject: thesis\nauthorization: Unselected candidate; Jörn must select a bounded packet before execution.\nnext_step: Select a bounded read-only Chapter 2/4 packet in its own worktree.\nSources: docs/coordination/thesis-work.md\n\nCheck variation and HKO certificate navigation\nRead Chapters 6/7 and HKO appendix against backlog item 2; separate finite predicates and geometric implication. The certificate and slope-to-neighborhood proof are reported present. No certificate recomputation.\nplan_gap: Independent candidate route; no separate assignment under this ID. Selected restart coverage is recorded under oct04-candidate and its owned packets.\nproject: thesis\nauthorization: Unselected candidate; Jörn must select a bounded packet before execution.\nnext_step: Select a bounded source-navigation review; coordinate Chapter 7 edits with the claim packet.\nSources: docs/coordination/thesis-work.md\n\nCheck product-family finite and limiting proof bridges\nRead Chapters 9–11 against backlog item 3: ordered pairings, finite vertex/alternation calculations, equality classification, product-position squeeze and Hausdorff/capacity-continuity bridge. Preserve exact/numerical distinctions.\nplan_gap: Independent candidate route; no separate assignment under this ID. Selec